h_xxh64":"0x99498BBD9A5D12E8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"선생님이랑 헤어지기 싫다면서 테미히아에게 찰싹 붙어있네?","female":"선생님이랑 헤어지기 싫다면서 테미히아에게 찰싹 붙어있네?","variant_male_record_index":"114392","variant_female_record_index":"114393","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013315004:1":{"text":"역시 테미히아는 여자들에게 인기가 많아요!","source_cn":"不愧是特弥希娅，还是这么受女孩子欢迎啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49F8113A6EFC3AC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013315005:2":{"text":"난 잘 모르겠는데... 페이, 너무 멀리 나온 것 같네요. 여기까지 배웅해 주었으니, 이제 충분해요. 돌아갈 때 조심하고요.","source_cn":"我倒是没注意过这种事……菲，你已经送我们走出这么长一段...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91315D774EE981F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013315006:2":{"text":"테미히아 언니도 몸조심하셔야 해요! 아, 언니한테 비밀 하나 말해도 될까요?","source_cn":"特弥希娅也是！一定要保重自己！可以偷偷告诉你一个秘密吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC3BBBBAB18528F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1013315007:1":{"text":"비밀이요?...","source_cn":"秘密……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67FDCD4751BF044B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1013315008:1":{"text":"전 언니가 정말 좋아요! 왜냐하면 테미히아 언니는... <style=\"highlight\">특별하거든요</style>! 제 말이 무슨 뜻인지 아실 거라고 믿어요.","source_cn":"我很喜欢特弥希娅哦！因为特弥希娅……<style=st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A02ED78083F6613","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1013315009:1":{"text":"잘 모르겠지만... 알 것 같기도 하네요.","source_cn":"我不确定……或许吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43884D2A0A5C3414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1013315010:1":{"text":"테미히아 언니가 많은 걸 짊어지고 있다고 생각해요. 전 아직 언니의 제일 친한 친구가 아니라서 그 마음을 다 이해할 수는 없지만...","source_cn":"我想，特弥希娅一定背负了很多。我还不是特弥希娅的好朋友...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9195F65E8664ADDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1013315011:1":{"text":"결국 혼자 짊어질 수밖에 없는 일이라면, 스스로에게 잘 대해줘요. 알았죠?... 그래야 버틸 수 있을 거예요...","source_cn":"既然无论如何都只能由你自己背负，至少对自己好一点，好吗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1AD7A27FD936F74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1013315012:1":{"text":"페이...","source_cn":"菲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x074E829AECB66771","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1013315013:1":{"text":"걱정해 줘서 고마워요. 페이는 정말 착한 사람이에요. 하지만 전 저에게 과분한 것들을 욕심낼 수 없어요.","source_cn":"多谢关心。你真善良，但我不该去奢求我不配得到的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2A668A0184E64EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1013315014:1":{"text":"모든 죗값을 치르고 나면 인자하신 듀라께서 저에게 잠깐이나마 안식을 주실지도 모르겠네요...","source_cn":"在罪孽赎清之后，也许仁慈的艾雅会赐给我片刻安宁吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A763EA4D7C0EA8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1013315015:1":{"text":"조심히 가요, 페이. 내 걱정은 말고요.","source_cn":"一路保重，菲，请别为我担心了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6928A450D617D1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"또 기회가 있을 거야","source_cn":"还有机会的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1B6CFED1FE0ADD8C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"또 기회가 있을 거야","female":"또 기회가 있을 거야","variant_male_record_index":"62032","variant_female_record_index":"62033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"혼자서도 노력해야지","source_cn":"自己也要努力","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x543D7829D6547A98","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"혼자서도 노력해야지","female":"혼자 하는 노력도 있어야 해","variant_male_record_index":"62034","variant_female_record_index":"62035","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","stat